Resilience4j dashboard sources
-----------------------------
The files local-lab/dashboards/classic.json and
local-lab/dashboards/recovery.json are unmodified copies of grafana_dashboard.json
and grafana_recovery_dashboard.json from the public Resilience4j fork:
https://github.com/xcapdevila/resilience4j

Resilience4j upstream attribution:
Copyright 2020 Robert Winkler, Bohdan Storozhuk, Mahmoud Romeh, Dan Maas and others.
https://github.com/resilience4j/resilience4j
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

local-lab/prepare-dashboard.py adapts generated copies for this lab. The checked-in
source dashboards retain their original contents; generated copies add local
provisioning, combined views and traffic-generator panels.

